        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This playbilll would have been kept by a member of the audience as a souvenir of a special occasion at the theatre. The cast of the opera that evening  was Mme. Melba, Miss Lucile Hill,  Mlle. Bauermeister, M. Planҫon, M. Bonnarde, M. Ghasne, M. Castlelmary, M. Villani, M. Coutellier and M. Jean de Reszke. The conductor was Signor Luigi Mancinelli"@en ;
